{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MotionSites AI — One Million</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#f3f0e8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}#root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden}canvas,svg.film{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.scene{opacity:0}.ink{fill:#171715}.paper{fill:#f3f0e8}.orange{fill:#ff643d}text{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-kerning:normal}.heavy{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-9px}.small{font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-1px}.rule{stroke:#171715;stroke-width:2}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"main\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-duration=\"24\">\n<canvas id=\"art\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n<svg class=\"film clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MotionSites AI celebrates one million monthly visitors eight months after launch.\">\n<g id=\"intro\" class=\"scene ink\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"52\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"-2\">MotionSites AI</text>\n<text x=\"112\" y=\"453\" font-size=\"153\" class=\"heavy\">An idea.</text>\n<text x=\"112\" y=\"610\" font-size=\"153\" class=\"heavy\">In motion.</text>\n<path d=\"M120 705H800\" class=\"rule\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"36\" class=\"small\">Prompts for websites that move.</text>\n</g>\n<g id=\"months\" class=\"scene ink\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"47\" class=\"small\">From launch to this.</text>\n<text x=\"104\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"390\" class=\"heavy\">8</text>\n<text x=\"380\" y=\"443\" font-size=\"142\" class=\"heavy\">months.</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"535\" font-size=\"42\" class=\"small\">And a milestone worth celebrating.</text>\n<g id=\"monthMarks\">\n<g id=\"m0\"><rect x=\"120\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"216\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m1\"><rect x=\"332\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m2\"><rect x=\"544\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"640\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m3\"><rect x=\"756\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"852\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m4\"><rect x=\"968\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"1064\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m5\"><rect x=\"1180\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"1276\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m6\"><rect x=\"1392\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#171715\"/><circle cx=\"1488\" cy=\"794\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\"/></g>\n<g id=\"m7\"><rect x=\"1604\" y=\"736\" width=\"193\" height=\"116\" rx=\"58\" fill=\"#ff643d\"/><path d=\"M1679 794l15 15 28-31\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#171715\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"million\" class=\"scene paper\">\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" class=\"small\">MotionSites AI just reached</text>\n<g id=\"millionNumber\"><text x=\"960\" y=\"589\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"300\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\"-16\">1,000,000</text></g>\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"79\" font-weight=\"500\" letter-spacing=\"-3\">monthly visitors.</text>\n<path id=\"milestoneRule\" d=\"M660 780H1260\" stroke=\"#ff643d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"881\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"38\" class=\"small\">Eight months after launch.</text>\n</g>\n<g id=\"workflow\" class=\"scene ink\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"50\" class=\"small\">Your next website starts here.</text>\n<g id=\"stepA\"><text x=\"120\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"108\" class=\"heavy\">Browse a design.</text><path d=\"M1530 355h208m-54-54 54 54-54 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff643d\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g>\n<path d=\"M120 458H1800\" class=\"rule\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n<g id=\"stepB\"><text x=\"120\" y=\"595\" font-size=\"108\" class=\"heavy\">Copy the prompt.</text><rect x=\"1612\" y=\"513\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff643d\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M1653 491h52a13 13 0 0 1 13 13v52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff643d\" stroke-width=\"8\"/></g>\n<path d=\"M120 648H1800\" class=\"rule\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n<g id=\"stepC\"><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"108\" class=\"heavy\">Build with AI.</text><path d=\"m1653 701 13 39 40 13-40 13-13 40-13-40-40-13 40-13Z\" fill=\"#ff643d\"/></g>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"941\" font-size=\"35\" class=\"small\">Ready-to-use website prompts. Your AI builder.</text>\n</g>\n<g id=\"ending\" class=\"scene ink\">\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"68\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"-3\">MotionSites AI</text>\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"451\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"139\" class=\"heavy\">Thanks for building</text>\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"599\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"139\" class=\"heavy\">with us.</text>\n<g id=\"cta\"><rect x=\"655\" y=\"710\" width=\"610\" height=\"108\" rx=\"54\" fill=\"#171715\"/><text x=\"940\" y=\"778\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"38\" fill=\"#f3f0e8\" font-weight=\"600\" letter-spacing=\"-1\">Explore the prompts</text><path d=\"M1166 780l29-29m-28 0h28v28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f3f0e8\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g>\n<text x=\"960\" y=\"901\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"37\" class=\"small\">motionsites.ai</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<script src=\"gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nconst canvas=document.getElementById('art');\nconst ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\nconst TAU=Math.PI*2;\nconst clock={t:0};\nconst palette={paper:[243,240,232],ink:[23,23,21],orange:[255,100,61]};\nconst clamp=(x)=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,x));\nconst smooth=(a,b,t)=>{let x=clamp((t-a)/(b-a));return x*x*(3-2*x)};\nconst mix=(a,b,p)=>a.map((v,i)=>Math.round(v+(b[i]-v)*p));\nconst color=(a)=>'rgb('+a.join(',')+')';\nfunction draw(t){\n let bg=palette.paper;\n bg=mix(bg,palette.ink,smooth(8.45,9,t));\n bg=mix(bg,palette.paper,smooth(14.45,15,t));\n bg=mix(bg,palette.orange,smooth(19.65,20.25,t));\n ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.fillStyle=color(bg);ctx.fillRect(0,0,1920,1080);\n const intro=1-smooth(3.9,4.6,t);\n if(intro>0){\n  ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=intro;\n  const cx=1378,cy=520;\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(23,23,21,.10)';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  for(let j=0;j<4;j++){ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(cx,cy,180+j*58,180+j*58,0,0,TAU);ctx.stroke()}\n  const strands=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<82;i++){\n   const p=i/82*TAU+t*.25;\n   strands.push({p:p,z:Math.sin(p)});\n  }\n  strands.sort((a,b)=>a.z-b.z);\n  for(const s of strands){\n   const p=s.p;\n   ctx.beginPath();\n   for(let j=0;j<=90;j++){\n    const q=j/90*TAU;\n    const radial=254+73*Math.cos(q);\n    const x=radial*Math.cos(p),y=radial*Math.sin(p),z=73*Math.sin(q);\n    const tilt=.64,yy=y*Math.cos(tilt)-z*Math.sin(tilt),zz=y*Math.sin(tilt)+z*Math.cos(tilt);\n    const perspective=1000/(1000-zz);\n    const px=cx+(x*.91+zz*.20)*perspective;\n    const py=cy+(yy*.86-x*.17)*perspective;\n    if(j===0)ctx.moveTo(px,py);else ctx.lineTo(px,py);\n   }\n   ctx.strokeStyle=s.z>0?'#ff643d':'#c53b1b';ctx.lineWidth=s.z>0?3.2:1.9;ctx.stroke();\n  }\n  ctx.restore();\n }\n const monthArt=smooth(4.1,4.7,t)*(1-smooth(8.1,8.7,t));\n if(monthArt>0){ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=monthArt;ctx.translate(1510,405);ctx.rotate((t-4.2)*.12);for(let j=0;j<8;j++){const a=j*TAU/8;ctx.save();ctx.rotate(a);ctx.fillStyle='#ff643d';ctx.beginPath();ctx.roundRect(76,-20,152,40,20);ctx.fill();ctx.restore()}ctx.restore()}\n const burst=smooth(8.5,9.3,t)*(1-smooth(14.1,14.8,t));\n if(burst>0){\n  ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=burst;\n  for(let i=0;i<68;i++){\n   const a=i*2.39996323;\n   const base=420+(i%7)*41;\n   const r=base+Math.sin(t*.65+i*.8)*17;\n   const x=960+Math.cos(a)*r*1.64,y=530+Math.sin(a)*r*.82;\n   ctx.fillStyle=i%4===0?'#ff643d':'rgba(243,240,232,.22)';\n   ctx.save();ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.rotate(a+t*.08);ctx.beginPath();ctx.roundRect(-3,-7,6,14,3);ctx.fill();ctx.restore();\n  }\n  ctx.restore();\n }\n const finalArt=smooth(20,20.7,t);\n if(finalArt>0){\n  ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=finalArt*.17;ctx.strokeStyle='#171715';ctx.lineWidth=2;\n  for(let j=0;j<7;j++){const r=310+j*52+Math.sin(t*.3+j*.3)*6;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(-85,550,r,r*1.35,-.35,0,TAU);ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(2005,550,r,r*1.35,.35,0,TAU);ctx.stroke()}\n  ctx.restore();\n }\n ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n}\nconst tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});\ntl.to(clock,{t:24,duration:24,ease:'none',onUpdate:function(){draw(clock.t)}},0);\nconst scenes=['#intro','#months','#million','#workflow','#ending'];\ntl.set(scenes,{opacity:0,y:36},0);\nfunction scene(id,start,end){\n tl.to(id,{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.65,ease:'power3.out'},start);\n if(end!==null)tl.to(id,{opacity:0,y:-24,duration:.4,ease:'power2.in'},end);\n}\nscene('#intro',.12,3.9);\nscene('#months',4.4,8.15);\nscene('#million',8.95,14.2);\nscene('#workflow',14.95,19.4);\nscene('#ending',20.15,null);\ntl.set('#monthMarks>g',{opacity:0,y:28},0);\ntl.to('#monthMarks>g',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.36,stagger:.16,ease:'power3.out'},5.1);\ntl.set('#millionNumber',{scale:.84,transformOrigin:'960px 500px'},0);\ntl.to('#millionNumber',{scale:1,duration:1.1,ease:'power3.out'},8.95);\ntl.set('#milestoneRule',{strokeDasharray:600,strokeDashoffset:600},0);\ntl.to('#milestoneRule',{strokeDashoffset:0,duration:.8,ease:'power3.inOut'},10.1);\ntl.set(['#stepA','#stepB','#stepC'],{opacity:0,x:45},0);\ntl.to('#stepA',{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.55,ease:'power3.out'},15.2);\ntl.to('#stepB',{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.55,ease:'power3.out'},16.1);\ntl.to('#stepC',{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.55,ease:'power3.out'},17);\ntl.set('#cta',{opacity:0,y:16},0);\ntl.to('#cta',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.6,ease:'power3.out'},21.15);\ntl.seek(0);\ndraw(0);\nwindow.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};\nwindow.__timelines['main']=tl;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","width":1920,"height":1080,"duration_seconds":24,"assumptions":["Chosen format: 24-second, 16:9, silent launch-milestone film with original vector artwork and editable text.","The one-million-monthly-visitors milestone and eight-month interval are creator-supplied claims; they were not independently verified. No intermediate traffic figures are depicted.","Product identity and prompt-based workflow were researched on the [official homepage](https://motionsites.ai/) and [official product overview](https://motionsites.ai/motionsite).","The palette and typeset brand name are creative treatments, not a verified brand system. No official logos, screenshots, third-party media or fonts are reproduced; no external asset licensing is required.","Uses the harness-supplied gsap.min.js dependency. This output has not been rendered or visually reviewed."],"missing_inputs":[],"summary":"A complete 24-second MotionSites AI milestone film featuring sculptural motion, eight-month markers, a one-million visitor reveal, the prompt workflow and a closing CTA."}